  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Sierbahnn",
      "content": "I think we can all agree that this is Megan, right? It is in essence the exact same story, just with a slightly more grown-up version of the same robot with a slightly different supporting cast, but it's still all Megan.\r\n\r\nIt is not as creepy as Megan, but that is partially because we've seen obsessive partners before and Megan lent another dimension to that, which this movie does not. It just leans heavily into the crazy possessive girlfriend and just makes her a killer robot that he is responsible for that isn't very innovative and that cheapens the movie. It's not a bad movie by any stretch but it is derivative of several other older works and if you wanted creepy robots you should probably just watch Megan instead.",
      "rating": 6,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-04T08:25:30Z"
    },
    {
      "author": "Gordon",
      "content": "I liked it better when it was called, 'Deadly Friend'.\r\n\r\nGoogle it.\r\n\r\nDeadly Friend came out in the 80's and was WAY better.",
      "rating": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-08T01:45:03Z"
    }
